#### Rust Backend Changes

##### [NEW] `src-tauri/src/state/membership.rs`
- `MembershipState` — in-memory materialized roster backed by `members` table.
- Methods: `add_member`, `remove_member`, `update_role`, `ban_member`, `get_roster`, `member_count`, `is_member`, `has_permission`.
