##### [MODIFY] [app_state.rs](file:///c:/Users/dhawa/Desktop/Creations/Applications/Mesh/mesh/src-tauri/src/state/app_state.rs)
- Add `membership: Arc<MembershipState>` to `AppState`.

##### [NEW] `src-tauri/src/commands/control.rs`
- `apply_control_event(community_id, event)` — processes a signed control-log event:
  - `channel_create` / `channel_delete`: updates `channels` table.
  - `member_join` / `member_leave`: updates `members` table + materialized roster.
  - `member_ban`: updates `ban_list` + `members` table, triggers key rotation.
  - `role_change`: updates `members` row.
  - `key_rotation`: unwraps new key, updates `communities.group_key`.
- All events are persisted in the `control_log` table and verified against the community owner or admin signature.

##### [MODIFY] [community.rs](file:///c:/Users/dhawa/Desktop/Creations/Applications/Mesh/mesh/src-tauri/src/commands/community.rs)
