## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **SQLCipher build complexity:** The `bundled-sqlcipher` feature compiles OpenSSL or uses system crypto libraries. On Windows, this may require extra build tooling (MSVC + `vcpkg`). **Should we use SQLCipher from day one, or start with keychain-derived encryption of just the `group_key` and `community_private_key` columns and add full-database encryption later?**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Default bootstrap/relay nodes:** The plan calls for shipping hardcoded bootstrap and relay endpoints. **Do you have VPS infrastructure ready for these, or should we add `stun.l.google.com` + public IPFS bootstrap nodes as temporary defaults?**

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Yjs removal scope:** Should we fully delete the Yjs npm packages and all CRDT-related Rust code in Milestone 2, or keep Yjs as a non-authoritative local cache for potential future collaborative features (e.g., shared documents)?

