- Voice store `communityId` scoping.

### Integration Scenarios
| Scenario | What it validates |
|----------|-------------------|
| Fresh create → invite → join | Full trust flow: key generation, invite v2, challenge-response, key delivery |
| Offline/restart recovery | Discovery cache, Kademlia pre-seeding, message history sync |
| Malicious history peer | History responses re-verified; bad signatures or banned authors dropped |
| Corrupted file chunks | SHA-256 hash mismatch detected, download marked failed, temp deleted |
| Banned member after key rotation | Old key stops working, new key distributed only to remaining members |
| 2-peer voice | Full mesh WebRTC signaling |
| 8-peer mesh voice | Full mesh at threshold boundary |
| 9-16 peer relay voice | Relay election, mesh-to-relay transition |

